sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI Runner
    participant TestBin as Go Test Binary
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NS as Test Namespace<br/>(auto-generated)
    participant Workload as Training Workload Pod
    participant Worker as MPI Worker Pods
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP
    participant RayDash as Ray Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over CI,K8sAPI: Flow 1: E2E Test Execution
        CI->>TestBin: Execute test suite
        TestBin->>K8sAPI: Create namespace (GenerateName)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>NS: Namespace created

        TestBin->>S3: Upload test data (optional)<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
        S3-->>TestBin: Upload confirmed

        TestBin->>K8sAPI: Create CRDs (PyTorchJob/TrainJob/RayCluster)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>NS: Resources created

        Note over NS,Workload: Platform operator reconciles CRDs

        Workload->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN bearer
        HF-->>Workload: Model artifacts

        Workload->>S3: Read/write training data<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
        S3-->>Workload: Data

        TestBin->>K8sAPI: Watch workload status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>TestBin: Status updates (WebSocket)

        TestBin->>Prom: Query metrics<br/>TLS: InsecureSkipVerify
        Prom-->>TestBin: Metrics data

        TestBin->>RayDash: Check Ray cluster health<br/>TLS: InsecureSkipVerify
        RayDash-->>TestBin: Cluster status
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over Workload,S3: Flow 2: MPI Distributed Training
        Workload->>Worker: SSH connection<br/>Port: 2222/TCP<br/>Auth: Auto-generated SSH keys
        Worker->>Worker: MPI inter-node communication<br/>Dynamic ports / RDMA / InfiniBand<br/>Encryption: None
        Worker->>S3: Shared storage access<br/>PVC or S3 HTTPS
        S3-->>Worker: Training data
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over TestBin,K8sAPI: Cleanup
        TestBin->>K8sAPI: Delete test namespace<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>TestBin: Namespace deleted
    end
